  <note>
    <title>🚀 Retrospective on migrating away from Evernote including every decision we made along the way and why the tooling had to be written from scratch instead of reused wholesale</title>
    <content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Long titles must be truncated without splitting a character.</div></en-note>]]></content>
    <created>20230102T000000Z</created>
    <updated>20230102T000000Z</updated>
    <tag>meta</tag>
    <tag>needs: review</tag>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>Duplicate title</title>
